//? Title: Deep Belief Networks: A Frozen Decoder and a Top RBM
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Native tensor graphs expose the deep belief experiment, with explicit inputs, derivatives and reproducible source fixtures. The complete editable program preserves the bounded source protocol and its checks.
)
